<!-- Adaptive-icon background for the Christmas alias: sky, moon, hill, ground and road, in that
     theme's own colours. Nothing here is invented for the icon: SceneTheme.CHRISTMAS.skyDusk for
     the sky ramp. This is the evening scene, which is why there is a moon and not a sun;
     hillColorsDay[1] and [0] sit below it.

     Containment: the only drawing that has to stay inside the safe zone is the moon, at 26.86 dp
     from the centre against a safe radius of 33 dp, so 6.14 dp of margin. Everything else in this
     file reaches the edge or lies outside the mask on purpose: sky, hill, ground, asphalt, centre
     line, snowflakes are background that bleeds under any launcher mask, and clipping them is the
     intended behaviour. -->
